<view class="ec fk-hover" bindtap="onTap" wx:if="{{item}}">
  <view class="ec-icon s-{{item.status}}">
    <text class="ec-icon-text">{{item.emoji}}</text>
    <view class="ec-pulse" wx:if="{{!isExpired}}"></view>
  </view>

  <view class="ec-main">
    <view class="ec-title">
      <text class="ec-name">{{item.name}}</text>
      <view class="fk-tag fk-tag-{{item.status}} ec-tag">{{statusText}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="ec-left">{{leftText}}</view>
    <view class="ec-tip" wx:if="{{suggestion}}">{{suggestion}}</view>
    <view class="ec-tip danger" wx:if="{{isExpired}}">
      建议检查食材状态，如有异味、变色、发黏等异常情况，请勿食用。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="ec-btn" catchtap="onCook">去做饭</view>
</view>
